      "time": "0d · 07:42:11",
      "textJa": "おはよう。早番、起きた人からえらい。",
      "parentId": "",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-life02",
      "handle": "nessa_six",
      "thread": "awake-and-chatting",
      "time": "0d · 07:46:23",
      "textJa": "アラームを止める夢を見てた。\n\n現実の方はまだ鳴ってた。",
      "parentId": "",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-life03",
      "handle": "freight_16",
      "thread": "awake-and-chatting",
      "time": "0d · 07:51:04",
      "textJa": "もう積んでる。今日こそ時間どおりに帰る。",
      "parentId": "zouka-life01",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-life04",
      "handle": "luz_turns_pages",
      "thread": "midgard-neighborhood",
      "time": "0d · 07:54:36",
      "textJa": "返却ポストの本を回収しました。昨夜返した分はこれから処理します。返却通知は少し待ってください。",
      "parentId": "",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-life05",
      "handle": "paperless_bird",
      "thread": "awake-and-chatting",
      "time": "0d · 07:57:41",
      "textJa": "昨夜のスープが残ってたので朝からちゃんと食べた。\n\n鍋まで洗った。ここで一日を終えたい。",
      "parentId": "",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-life06",
      "handle": "violet_pad",
      "thread": "late-night-matches",
      "time": "0d · 08:01:17",
      "textJa": "部屋の設定、昨日のを保存してあります。変えてほしいところあったら昼までに書いといて。",
      "parentId": "",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-life07",
      "handle": "S_Enmi_Parapsych",
      "thread": "awake-and-chatting",
      "time": "0d · 08:04:28",
      "textJa": "点滴の交換に来た看護師に、昨夜読んだ論文の話をした。\n\n「続きは交代の者にお願いします」だそうだ。ずいぶん引き継ぎの手際がよい。",
      "parentId": "",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-life08",
      "handle": "camber_line",
      "thread": "awake-and-chatting",
      "time": "0d · 08:06:39",
      "textJa": "片方の手袋がない。昨日の店に置いてきた気がするけど、まだ開いてない。",
      "parentId": "",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-life09",
      "handle": "window_warm",
      "thread": "midgard-neighborhood",
      "time": "0d · 08:10:05",
      "textJa": "弁当を作り終えてから、今日は要らないって連絡が来た。\n\n先に言ってほしい。冷蔵庫に入れた。夜に食べてもらいます。",
      "parentId": "",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-life10",
      "handle": "old_cable_h",
      "thread": "helheim-daily",
      "time": "0d · 08:12:19",
      "textJa": "今日は昼に一度店を閉める。戻るの一時くらい。修理品の受け取りはそれ以降で頼む。",
      "parentId": "",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-life11",
      "handle": "sana_belkacem",
      "thread": "awake-and-chatting",
      "time": "0d · 08:15:32",
      "textJa": "出掛ける前に荷物を開けるんじゃなかった。緩衝材を片づける時間がない。\n\n帰宅後の自分に頼みます。",
      "parentId": "",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-life12",
      "handle": "inklong_88",
      "thread": "awake-and-chatting",
      "time": "0d · 08:18:49",
      "textJa": "髪が片側だけ跳ねてる。これ以上遅刻する理由にできないので出る。",
      "parentId": "",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-life13",
      "handle": "nessa_six",
      "thread": "awake-and-chatting",
      "time": "0d · 08:21:07",
      "textJa": "それ、次の人に押しつけて帰っただけでは。",
      "parentId": "zouka-life07",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-life14",
      "handle": "two_frames_late",
      "thread": "late-night-matches",
      "time": "0d · 08:24:32",
      "textJa": "音量だけ下げといて。入った瞬間の効果音がでかい。",
      "parentId": "zouka-life06",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-life15",
      "handle": "mira_at_night",
      "thread": "awake-and-chatting",
      "time": "0d · 08:28:56",
      "textJa": "今日は弁当あるから途中で何も買わない。\n\n毎日こうやって出れば昼代が浮くはずなんだよな。",
      "parentId": "",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-life16",
      "handle": "pepper_has_chair",
      "thread": "midgard-neighborhood",
      "time": "0d · 08:31:17",
      "textJa": "椅子届いた。組み立ててから仕事します。\n\n工具が付いてて助かった。",
      "parentId": "",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-life17",
      "handle": "keel_home",
      "thread": "awake-and-chatting",
      "time": "0d · 08:34:50",
      "textJa": "今日は早く仕事が終わる予定。何をするか決める前からもう嬉しい。",
      "parentId": "",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-life18",
      "handle": "S_Enmi_Parapsych",
      "thread": "awake-and-chatting",
      "time": "0d · 08:37:24",
      "textJa": "承知しているよ。もう少し暇な人はいないかと思って、こちらへ来たところだ。",
      "parentId": "zouka-life13",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-life19",
      "handle": "talia_reed",
      "thread": "midgard-neighborhood",
      "time": "0d · 08:40:47",
      "textJa": "午前の用事を一つ済ませた。出直さなくてよかった。書類の予備、持っていってよかったです。",
      "parentId": "",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-life20",
      "handle": "mend_by_eight",
      "thread": "rooms-and-repairs",
      "time": "0d · 08:44:13",
      "textJa": "今日は八時まで開けています。見積もりだけの方もどうぞ。\n\n預かり品の受け取りは伝票があると早いです。",
      "parentId": "",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-life21",
      "handle": "oren_bell",
      "thread": "awake-and-chatting",
      "time": "0d · 08:47:52",
      "textJa": "朝のラジオで知らない曲が流れて、途中からずっと聴いてた。曲名を聞く前に仕事場へ着いてしまった。",
      "parentId": "",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-life22",
      "handle": "S_Enmi_Parapsych",
      "thread": "enmi-fieldnotes",
      "time": "0d · 08:51:10",
      "textJa": "病室の枕元に本を積みすぎだと言われたので、二冊は電子版で読むことにして片づけた。\n\n空いた所には、あと三冊ほど置ける。",
      "parentId": "",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-life23",
      "handle": "rounds_after",
      "thread": "awake-and-chatting",
      "time": "0d · 08:54:18",
      "textJa": "朝ご飯を食べながら本の発送通知を読んでた。\n\n昨日届いた箱もまだ開けてない。",
      "parentId": "",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-life24",
      "handle": "violet_pad",
      "thread": "late-night-matches",
      "time": "0d · 08:58:37",
      "textJa": "直した。自分でも鳴らしてびっくりしたｗ",
      "parentId": "zouka-life14",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-life25",
      "handle": "folkpond",
      "thread": "awake-and-chatting",
      "time": "0d · 09:08:28",
      "textJa": "電脳食の月額プラン、食べたいものがおおむね追加料金の方にある。",
      "parentId": "",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-life26",
      "handle": "window_warm",
      "thread": "awake-and-chatting",
      "time": "0d · 09:14:42",
      "textJa": "番組のページに今朝かかった曲の一覧あるよ。時刻も書いてある。",
      "parentId": "zouka-life21",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-life27",
      "handle": "marta_seidel",
      "thread": "awake-and-chatting",
      "time": "0d · 09:23:19",
      "textJa": "「会議室を変更しました」という紙が、変更前の会議室の扉に貼ってありました。\n\n先に連絡が欲しかったです。",
      "parentId": "",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-life28",
      "handle": "pepper_has_chair",
      "thread": "rooms-and-repairs",
      "time": "0d · 09:30:51",
      "textJa": "古い椅子の引き取りもお願いできますか。買い替えたので。",
      "parentId": "zouka-life20",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-life29",
      "handle": "sora_loading",
      "thread": "awake-and-chatting",
      "time": "0d · 09:38:14",
      "textJa": "それ昨日も言ってた。\n\n今日は俺も早く帰りたい。",
      "parentId": "zouka-life03",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-life30",
      "handle": "nessa_six",
      "thread": "awake-and-chatting",
      "time": "0d · 09:47:13",
      "textJa": "公演の抽選また落ちた。\n\n空けてた日の予定を戻すか、別の所に出掛けるか迷う。",
      "parentId": "",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-life31",
      "handle": "rashid_mansur",
      "thread": "midgard-neighborhood",
      "time": "0d · 09:55:49",
      "textJa": "帰りに古書市を覗く予定です。今日は閉まる前に着けそう。",
      "parentId": "",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-prov01",
      "handle": "bent_spoon_jpg",
      "thread": "midgard-neighborhood",
      "time": "0d · 09:56:22",
      "textJa": "危険物にも人権があるとかいうなら、造花は静寂先生の家に送り付けろ。",
      "parentId": "",
      "quoteId": "zouka-a09",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-life32",
      "handle": "mend_by_eight",
      "thread": "rooms-and-repairs",
      "time": "0d · 10:02:56",
      "textJa": "うちは修理だけです。引き取り処分は別の窓口になります。",
      "parentId": "zouka-life28",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-prov02",
      "handle": "S_Enmi_Parapsych",
      "thread": "midgard-neighborhood",
      "time": "0d · 10:03:14",
      "textJa": "ほう。権利を認めると、私の家に収容設備まで備わるのか。\n\n私宅なら安全に管理できるとは述べていない。危険を管理する条件が必要だという話なら、最初からしているよ。\n\n引っ越し先を決める前に、もう少し読んでいってはどうかね。",
      "parentId": "zouka-prov01",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-prov05",
      "handle": "inklong_88",
      "thread": "enmi-fieldnotes",
      "time": "0d · 10:06:40",
      "textJa": "人殺しを推奨してる静寂は殺人幇助で捕まるべき。",
      "parentId": "enmi-luna-assessment",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-prov03",
      "handle": "bent_spoon_jpg",
      "thread": "midgard-neighborhood",
      "time": "0d · 10:07:26",
      "textJa": "じゃあ自分じゃ飼わないのかよｗ\n\n安全な所から綺麗事言うだけなら誰でもできるわ。",
      "parentId": "zouka-prov02",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-life33",
      "handle": "talia_reed",
      "thread": "midgard-neighborhood",
      "time": "0d · 10:09:42",
      "textJa": "図書室の読み聞かせ、今日は何時からですか。",
      "parentId": "",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-prov04",
      "handle": "S_Enmi_Parapsych",
      "thread": "midgard-neighborhood",
      "time": "0d · 10:16:18",
      "textJa": "ええ、私が引き取れば安全になるとは主張していないのでね。\n\n君も危険をなくしたいのかと思っていたが、私の家に届けば満足らしい。おやおや、それなら治安の話に付き合わせて悪かった。",
      "parentId": "zouka-prov03",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-life34",
      "handle": "folkpond",
      "thread": "awake-and-chatting",
      "time": "0d · 10:18:06",
      "textJa": "海老天だけ別料金って何。\n\n定額で何を揚げてくれるんだ。",
      "parentId": "zouka-life25",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-prov06",
      "handle": "S_Enmi_Parapsych",
      "thread": "enmi-fieldnotes",
      "time": "0d · 10:18:54",
      "textJa": "ほう、罪名まで付けてくれたのか。\n\n私の判断への反対と、私が具体的な殺人を幇助したという主張は別だよ。どの行為を指しているのかね。そこまで調べてくれたのであれば、続きを伺いたい。",
      "parentId": "zouka-prov05",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-life35",
      "handle": "eamon_quay",
      "thread": "awake-and-chatting",
      "time": "0d · 10:26:51",
      "textJa": "午後は少し歩くつもりです。運動というほどではないけれど、用事がないと机を離れないので。",
      "parentId": "",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-prov07",
      "handle": "inklong_88",
      "thread": "enmi-fieldnotes",
      "time": "0d · 10:30:22",
      "textJa": "「無実でも殺していい」って広めるのが後押しになるだろ。\n\n実際に殺されてからじゃ遅いんだけど。",
      "parentId": "zouka-prov06",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-life36",
      "handle": "marta_seidel",
      "thread": "awake-and-chatting",
      "time": "0d · 10:34:43",
      "textJa": "移動先の会議室は誰もいませんでした。開始時間も変わっていたそうです。",
      "parentId": "zouka-life27",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-life37",
      "handle": "smallbone_t",
      "thread": "awake-and-chatting",
      "time": "0d · 10:42:37",
      "textJa": "今やっと朝の雑談まで追いついた。休憩終わる。",
      "parentId": "zouka-life01",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-prov08",
      "handle": "S_Enmi_Parapsych",
      "thread": "enmi-fieldnotes",
      "time": "0d · 10:42:58",
      "textJa": "その影響への批判なら受けよう。私は、自分の発言が他人の判断に利用されうることを否定していない。\n\nただ、君は今、殺人幇助で私を捕まえるべきだと書いた。その根拠を聞いている。\n\n君が私を嫌っていることには、これ以上の立証は要らないよ。そこはもう、十分に伝わっている。",
      "parentId": "zouka-prov07",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-life38",
      "handle": "luz_turns_pages",
      "thread": "midgard-neighborhood",
      "time": "0d · 10:50:19",
      "textJa": "正午からです。予約はいりません。少し遅れても大丈夫ですよ。",
      "parentId": "zouka-life33",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-prov09",
      "handle": "inklong_88",
      "thread": "midgard-neighborhood",
      "time": "0d · 10:51:42",
      "textJa": "詳しいねえ。捕まらない範囲で人が死ぬ話をするために勉強したの？",
      "parentId": "",
      "quoteId": "zouka-prov08",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-life39",
      "handle": "pepper_has_chair",
      "thread": "rooms-and-repairs",
      "time": "0d · 10:58:46",
      "textJa": "了解です。しばらく二脚とも置いておきます。猫が使うので。",
      "parentId": "zouka-life32",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-life40",
      "handle": "nessa_six",
      "thread": "awake-and-chatting",
      "time": "0d · 11:07:38",
      "textJa": "天かす。",
      "parentId": "zouka-life34",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-life41",
      "handle": "inklong_88",
      "thread": "awake-and-chatting",
      "time": "0d · 11:14:26",
      "textJa": "寝癖やっと直った。午前の用事はだいたい終わってる。",
      "parentId": "zouka-life12",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-prov15",
      "handle": "axiom_lad",
      "thread": "midgard-neighborhood",
      "time": "0d · 11:17:09",
      "textJa": "造花とかいう危険物を保護する運動を停止させないアレク・ハールバルズは名誉造花だからYDFは早くこいつを捕まえるべき。",
      "parentId": "",
      "quoteId": "zouka-36",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-life42",
      "handle": "oren_bell",
      "thread": "awake-and-chatting",
      "time": "0d · 11:21:33",
      "textJa": "見つかりました、ありがとう。知らない歌手だったので他の曲も聴いてみます。",
      "parentId": "zouka-life26",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-prov16",
      "handle": "S_Enmi_Parapsych",
      "thread": "midgard-neighborhood",
      "time": "0d · 11:27:19",
      "textJa": "成程。保護運動を止めない者まで造花に数えるのか。\n\nハールバルズ氏を逮捕しないＹＤＦも、その基準なら造花になりそうだが。その場合、次は誰を呼ぶつもりかね。",
      "parentId": "zouka-prov15",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-life43",
      "handle": "peripheral_zero",
      "thread": "helheim-daily",
      "time": "0d · 11:29:07",
      "textJa": "誰か靴用の乾燥機貸してくれ。昼に戻れるなら寄りたい。",
      "parentId": "",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-prov17",
      "handle": "axiom_lad",
      "thread": "midgard-neighborhood",
      "time": "0d · 11:35:41",
      "textJa": "そういう揚げ足取りしてる間に何か起きたらどうするんですか？\n\n上に立つ人間には止める責任があるでしょう。",
      "parentId": "zouka-prov16",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-life44",
      "handle": "talia_reed",
      "thread": "midgard-neighborhood",
      "time": "0d · 11:36:26",
      "textJa": "ありがとうございます。少し遅れるかもしれませんが、伺います。",
      "parentId": "zouka-life38",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-life45",
      "handle": "folkpond",
      "thread": "awake-and-chatting",
      "time": "0d · 11:43:53",
      "textJa": "年額にしなくてよかった。",
      "parentId": "zouka-life40",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-prov18",
      "handle": "S_Enmi_Parapsych",
      "thread": "midgard-neighborhood",
      "time": "0d · 11:45:29",
      "textJa": "私が尋ねているのは、君の基準に従った時、どこで逮捕が終わるのかということだよ。\n\n君を満足させない者を順に造花へ数えていけば、さぞ大きな事件に見えるだろうね。捜査の前から、これほど成果が上がるとは。",
      "parentId": "zouka-prov17",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-life46",
      "handle": "bent_spoon_jpg",
      "thread": "awake-and-chatting",
      "time": "0d · 11:51:34",
      "textJa": "辛さ「普通」で頼んだのに普通じゃない。\n\n店の人が平然と同じの食ってる。",
      "parentId": "",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-prov10",
      "handle": "feed_wick",
      "thread": "midgard-neighborhood",
      "time": "0d · 11:58:24",
      "textJa": "テセウスさんこっちです",
      "parentId": "",
      "quoteId": "zouka-prov04",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-life47",
      "handle": "lemon_wire",
      "thread": "awake-and-chatting",
      "time": "0d · 11:58:26",
      "textJa": "店の普通なんだろ。",
      "parentId": "zouka-life46",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-prov11",
      "handle": "S_Enmi_Parapsych",
      "thread": "midgard-neighborhood",
      "time": "0d · 12:02:47",
      "textJa": "おや、今度は付き添いが要るのか。\n\n君一人でも話してくれてよいのだよ。",
      "parentId": "zouka-prov10",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-prov12",
      "handle": "feed_wick",
      "thread": "midgard-neighborhood",
      "time": "0d · 12:04:38",
      "textJa": "先生みたいな偉い人の話は、偉い人同士でやってもらった方がいいかなってｗ",
      "parentId": "zouka-prov11",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-life48",
      "handle": "nessa_six",
      "thread": "rooms-and-repairs",
      "time": "0d · 12:04:54",
      "textJa": "鉢の受け皿だけ買い替えたいんだけど、鉢の底の幅で選べばいいのかな。",
      "parentId": "",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-prov13",
      "handle": "S_Enmi_Parapsych",
      "thread": "midgard-neighborhood",
      "time": "0d · 12:07:31",
      "textJa": "そう遠慮しなくても。私についての話なら、君自身も随分してくれているではないか。\n\nわざわざ代わりの人を探してくれなくても、その続きを聞かせてくれればよいのだよ。",
      "parentId": "zouka-prov12",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-life49",
      "handle": "marta_seidel",
      "thread": "awake-and-chatting",
      "time": "0d · 12:11:35",
      "textJa": "会議、結局端末越しになりました。朝から歩いた分は運動に数えます。",
      "parentId": "zouka-life36",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-prov14",
      "handle": "feed_wick",
      "thread": "midgard-neighborhood",
      "time": "0d · 12:12:43",
      "textJa": "軽く呼んだだけなのに引き留め方が重いｗ",
      "parentId": "",
      "quoteId": "zouka-prov13",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-life50",
      "handle": "rashid_mansur",
      "thread": "midgard-neighborhood",
      "time": "0d · 12:17:56",
      "textJa": "閉まる時間を一時間間違えていました。今日は覗くだけになりそうです。",
      "parentId": "zouka-life31",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-life51",
      "handle": "worn_socket",
      "thread": "helheim-daily",
      "time": "0d · 12:22:31",
      "textJa": "箱、十三時過ぎでいい？　昼閉めるって朝の投稿いま見た。",
      "parentId": "zouka-life10",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-life52",
      "handle": "old_cable_h",
      "thread": "helheim-daily",
      "time": "0d · 12:27:16",
      "textJa": "いい。来る前に一言くれ。",
      "parentId": "zouka-life51",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-life53",
      "handle": "camber_line",
      "thread": "awake-and-chatting",
      "time": "0d · 12:31:47",
      "textJa": "手袋、店で預かってくれてた。取りに行く。",
      "parentId": "zouka-life08",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "zouka-life54",
      "handle": "sora_loading",
      "thread": "awake-and-chatting",
      "time": "0d · 12:35:41",
      "textJa": "午後の便に出ます。\n\n休憩室の麦茶、そろそろ切れそう。戻る人がいたら足しといて。",
      "parentId": "",
      "quoteId": "",
      "quoteExcerptJa": "",
      "image": "",
      "imageAltJa": "",
      "noticeJa": ""
    }
